# Pricing & Eligibility API: example requests for every scenario.
# Run with the IntelliJ HTTP Client or the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
# Start the service first: docker compose up --build --wait  (or run it with Maven).
# Business rejections return HTTP 200 with "eligible": false; only invalid requests return 400.

@pricingUrl = http://localhost:8081
@requestId = 7cb82db3-fe9a-49e1-a0f9-fdeae2455869

### Health check -> 200 {"status":"UP"}
GET {{pricingUrl}}/actuator/health

########## Eligible: HTTP 200, "eligible": true ##########

### Assignment example: NEXT_DAY 2,750 g from an urban area -> 8.95 (6.95 base + 1.00 weight + 1.00 urban)
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: example-eligible-1

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "1012 AB",
  "destinationPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "weightInGrams": 2750,
  "deliveryType": "NEXT_DAY"
}

### STANDARD 2,000 g, outside the urban area -> 4.95 (base price only, no weight surcharge)
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "destinationPostalCode": "3011AB",
  "weightInGrams": 2000,
  "deliveryType": "STANDARD"
}

### STANDARD 20,000 g, the heaviest eligible parcel -> 9.95 (4.95 base + 5.00 weight)
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "destinationPostalCode": "3011AB",
  "weightInGrams": 20000,
  "deliveryType": "STANDARD"
}

### Both postal codes urban -> 5.95 (urban surcharge charged once)
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "1012AB",
  "destinationPostalCode": "1099ZZ",
  "weightInGrams": 500,
  "deliveryType": "STANDARD"
}

### SAME_DAY within the same four-digit area, 15,000 g -> 17.95 (11.95 base + 5.00 weight + 1.00 urban)
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "1012AB",
  "destinationPostalCode": "1012XY",
  "weightInGrams": 15000,
  "deliveryType": "SAME_DAY"
}

########## Business rejections: HTTP 200, "eligible": false ##########

### Weight above 20,000 g -> WEIGHT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "destinationPostalCode": "3011AB",
  "weightInGrams": 20001,
  "deliveryType": "STANDARD"
}

### SAME_DAY between different four-digit areas -> SAME_DAY_NOT_SUPPORTED
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "destinationPostalCode": "1012AB",
  "weightInGrams": 100,
  "deliveryType": "SAME_DAY"
}

### Both rules fail -> WEIGHT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED (the weight rule is checked first)
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "destinationPostalCode": "1012AB",
  "weightInGrams": 25000,
  "deliveryType": "SAME_DAY"
}

########## Invalid requests: HTTP 400, application/problem+json, code VALIDATION_FAILED ##########

### Missing field (destinationPostalCode) -> 400 with a violation for that field
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: example-invalid-1

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "1012AB",
  "weightInGrams": 2750,
  "deliveryType": "NEXT_DAY"
}

### Invalid Dutch postal code -> 400 (the value is not echoed in the response)
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "0123AB",
  "destinationPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "weightInGrams": 2750,
  "deliveryType": "NEXT_DAY"
}

### Zero weight -> 400
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "1012AB",
  "destinationPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "weightInGrams": 0,
  "deliveryType": "NEXT_DAY"
}

### Negative weight -> 400
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "1012AB",
  "destinationPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "weightInGrams": -1,
  "deliveryType": "NEXT_DAY"
}

### Unsupported delivery type -> 400
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "1012AB",
  "destinationPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "weightInGrams": 2750,
  "deliveryType": "EXPRESS"
}

### Malformed JSON -> 400
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId": "{{requestId}}", "originPostalCode": "1012AB"

### X-Correlation-ID longer than 128 characters -> 400
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

{
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}",
  "originPostalCode": "1012AB",
  "destinationPostalCode": "5611EM",
  "weightInGrams": 2750,
  "deliveryType": "NEXT_DAY"
}

########## Unsupported requests: Problem Details with code REQUEST_NOT_SUPPORTED ##########

### Wrong HTTP method -> 405
GET {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations

### Wrong content type -> 415
POST {{pricingUrl}}/api/v1/pricing/evaluations
Content-Type: text/plain

not json
